lan from current owner state; its returned planDigest binds requestId, baseversion/digest, exact changed fields, lowered typed bytes, target config digest, actual capabilities, complete lostSnapshotIds and all effects. No supplied digest is itself permission."],["string","apply may only consume the previously computed exact plan for this owner/request/base. Stop admitting animation samples; resolve in-flight sample and draft barriers; preflight exact lost snapshots and require a separately authorized explicit confirmation bound to that plan. A consent from an earlier revision or a subset/superset list does not authorize trim."],["string","private existing preference owner serializes one whole generation. Durable write -> exact byte readback -> one effective install/version -> notify consumers. Unknown write must query same apply/generation; no new apply, close-as-success or current-document Saved. Failure before durable write leaves prior effective config; later failure never invents rollback."],["string","OK closes after actual effective installation only; Cancel drops remaining unapplied RAM draft while preserving previous successful Apply. Preferences, including history capacity trim, do not change current document revision/content/workref, and never store work bytes in browser storage."],["string","timer consumers capture a preferenceVersion per admitted sample; applying preferences never changes an in-flight sample halfway. Existing unrelated scientific jobs may retain old nonsecurity preferences; revocation still follows current authority policy immediately."],["string","u64/field cardinality and a closed schema prove transport membership only; native semantic labels, source conversion, runtime FPCR or actual publication remain separately qualified."]]]]]]]]]]]